Keep a shared source as empty text.
Place "dir\n\tsubdir1\n\tsubdir2\n\t\tfile.ext" into source.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared depth as 0.
Keep a shared isfile as 0.

To measure.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of current.
If character spot of current is not "\t", break.
Add 1 to depth.

To mark.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of current.
If character spot of current is ".", set isfile to 1, break.

The parts is split source by "\n".
The lastpart is the last position of parts.
The prefix is a list of 20 zeros.
The best is 0.
For every index from 0 to lastpart.
Set current to item index of parts.
Set depth to 0.
Measure.
The deep is depth.
The last is the last position of current.
The size is last plus 1.
The name is the slice of current from deep to size.
The final is the last position of name.
The namelen is final plus 1.
Set current to name.
Set isfile to 0.
Mark.
The candidate is 0.
The total is 0.
If isfile is 1, set candidate to namelen.
If isfile is 1 and deep is more than 0, set candidate to candidate plus item (deep minus 1) of prefix.
If isfile is 1 and deep is more than 0, set candidate to candidate plus 1.
If isfile is 1 and candidate is more than best, set best to candidate.
If isfile is 0, set total to namelen.
If isfile is 0 and deep is more than 0, set total to total plus item (deep minus 1) of prefix.
If isfile is 0 and deep is more than 0, set total to total plus 1.
If isfile is 0, set item deep of prefix to total.

Show best.
